<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>15th Down Scouting Ireland</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: #f2f5f0;
            color: #243326;
        }
        header {
            background: #173b25;
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 10px;
            text-align: center;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
        }
        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #2d6840;
            padding: 9px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        nav a:hover {
            background: #5d9b68;
        }
        .hero {
            min-height: 80vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            color: white;
            background: linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                #173b25,
                #2d6840,
                #477b45
            );
        }
        .hero-content {
            max-width: 800px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 55px;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 14px 24px;
            background: #f0b429;
            color: #172719;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        section {
            padding: 65px 20px;
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
        }
        section h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #173b25;
            font-size: 35px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        section > p {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }
        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(
                auto-fit,
                minmax(220px, 1fr)
            );
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 18px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
        }
        .icon {
            font-size: 45px;
        }
        .card h3 {
            color: #173b25;
        }
        #activities {
            max-width: none;
            background: #e5eee3;
        }
        #adventure {
            max-width: none;
            background: #f8f3e7;
        }
        #life {
            max-width: none;
            background: #f2f5f0;
        }
        #documents {
            max-width: none;
            background: #e8f0e5;
        }
        .pdf-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            background: #f0b429;
            color: #172719;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .contact-section {
            max-width: none;
            background: #173b25;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .contact-section h2 {
            color: white;
        }
        .contact-section p {
            color: white;
        }
        footer {
            background: #102819;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 25px 15px;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }
            .hero p {
                font-size: 17px;
            }
            nav a {
                font-size: 12px;
                padding: 8px 10px;
            }
            section {
                padding: 50px 15px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
    <div class="logo">
        🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland
    </div>
    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About Us</a>
        <a href="#activities">Activities</a>
        <a href="#adventure">Adventure</a>
        <a href="#life">Our Life</a>
        <a href="#documents">Documents</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>
<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>
            🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland
        </h1>
        <p>
            Adventure • Friendship • Skills • Community
        </p>
        <p>
            Welcome to 15th Down Scouting Ireland —
            a place where young people learn new skills,
            explore the outdoors and create memories together.
        </p>
        <a href="#about" class="button">
            Explore Our Scouts 🧭
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="about">
    <h2>
        🧭 About Us
    </h2>
    <p>
        15th Down Scouting Ireland is all about adventure,
        teamwork, learning and having fun. Scouting gives
        young people the opportunity to try new things,
        build confidence and make lifelong friendships.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            <h3>
                Teamwork
            </h3>
            <p>
                Working together and supporting each other.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌲</div>
            <h3>
                Outdoors
            </h3>
            <p>
                Exploring the countryside and enjoying the outdoors.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">⭐</div>
            <h3>
                Personal Growth
            </h3>
            <p>
                Learning skills and becoming more confident.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="activities">
    <h2>
        🔥 Activities
    </h2>
    <p>
        There is always something exciting happening in scouting.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏕️</div>
            <h3>
                Camping
            </h3>
            <p>
                Get outdoors and experience life under canvas.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🔥</div>
            <h3>
                Campfires
            </h3>
            <p>
                Stories, games, food and great memories around the fire.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🥾</div>
            <h3>
                Hiking
            </h3>
            <p>
                Explore trails and discover new places.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧭</div>
            <h3>
                Navigation
            </h3>
            <p>
                Learn how to navigate using maps and compasses.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="adventure">
    <h2>
        🥾 Adventure &amp; Skills
    </h2>
    <p>
        Scouting isn't just about having fun.
        It's about learning useful skills that can
        be used throughout life.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🪢</div>
            <h3>
                Knots
            </h3>
            <p>
                Learn useful knots and pioneering skills.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🗺️</div>
            <h3>
                Map Reading
            </h3>
            <p>
                Learn to understand maps and plan routes.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🚑</div>
            <h3>
                First Aid
            </h3>
            <p>
                Develop important first-aid and emergency skills.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏆</div>
            <h3>
                Challenges
            </h3>
            <p>
                Take on challenges and learn from new experiences.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="life">
    <h2>
        📸 Our Scouting Life
    </h2>
    <p>
        From camps and hikes to activities and community events,
        scouting is packed with moments worth remembering.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏕️</div>
            <h3>
                Camp Life
            </h3>
            <p>
                Making memories outdoors with friends.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🌄</div>
            <h3>
                Adventure
            </h3>
            <p>
                Getting outside and discovering somewhere new.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">📸</div>
            <h3>
                Memories
            </h3>
            <p>
                Capturing the moments that make scouting special.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section id="documents">
    <h2>
        📄 Documents
    </h2>
    <p>
        Find useful information, forms and documents
        from 15th Down Scouting Ireland.
    </p>
    <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">📋</div>
            <h3>
                Permission Forms
            </h3>
            <p>
                View and download scouting permission forms.
            </p>
            <a
                href="permission-form.pdf"
                class="pdf-button"
                target="_blank"
            >
                📄 View PDF
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🏕️</div>
            <h3>
                Camp Information
            </h3>
            <p>
                Important information for upcoming camps.
            </p>
            <a
                href="camp-information.pdf"
                class="pdf-button"
                target="_blank"
            >
                📄 View PDF
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="icon">🧭</div>
            <h3>
                Adventure Skills Handbook
            </h3>
            <p>
                Learn outdoor skills, techniques and useful
                scouting knowledge.
            </p>
            <a
                href="Adventure-skills-handbook.pdf"
                class="pdf-button"
                target="_blank"
            >
                📖 View Handbook
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="contact-section" id="contact">
    <h2>
        📧 Contact Us
    </h2>
    <p>
        Want to find out more about 15th Down Scouting Ireland?
        Get in touch with us.
    </p>
    <a
        href="mailto:15thdownscouts@gmail.com"
        class="button"
    >
        Contact Us 📧
    </a>
</section>
<footer>
    <p>
        🌲 15th Down Scouting Ireland
    </p>
    <p>
        Adventure • Skills • Friendship • Community
    </p>
    <p>
        © 2026 15th Down Scouting Ireland
    </p>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
